# Trivy ignore file — intentionally empty.
#
# The runtime image (root Dockerfile) uninstalls pip after the package
# install, so pip's vendored setuptools / msgpack / urllib3 copies are no
# longer present and no advisory needs to be suppressed. Any finding the image
# scan reports is now a real, actionable finding.
#
# If a suppression is ever added here, it must name one specific advisory ID,
# state why it is un-actionable and unreachable, and be revisited on every
# base-image or dependency bump.
